  C = B' (antisym) Sh_Phi : max_b|beta_b(z1,z2) - beta_b(z2,z1)| =   1258 (Grassmann/Majorana-consistent iff 0); max_b|beta + beta^t| =      0 (bosonic s.a. iff 0); max|beta| = 629
  C = B' (antisym) Sh_Phi': max_b|beta_b(z1,z2) - beta_b(z2,z1)| =    718 (Grassmann/Majorana-consistent iff 0); max_b|beta + beta^t| =      0 (bosonic s.a. iff 0); max|beta| = 359
  C = B' (antisym) Sh_gam : max_b|beta_b(z1,z2) - beta_b(z2,z1)| =    394 (Grassmann/Majorana-consistent iff 0); max_b|beta + beta^t| =    253 (bosonic s.a. iff 0); max|beta| = 200
  C = B : Grassmann-defect matrix on (s Sh_Phi + t Sh_gam): exact rank 2 of 2; null space []
  C = B': Grassmann-defect matrix on (s Sh_Phi + t Sh_gam): exact rank 2 of 2; null space []

=== F3. Symmetry of C gamma_I on S^eps x S^eps (eps = +, -), all monomials of grades 1,3,5,7 ===
  C = B : k=1: ['antisym']; k=3: ['sym']; k=5: ['antisym']; k=7: ['sym']
  C = B': k=1: ['antisym']; k=3: ['sym']; k=5: ['antisym']; k=7: ['sym']
  even grades vanish on S^eps x S^eps (C pairs S^eps with S^-eps).  Hence (Schur + dimensions 14+2002 = 2016,
  364+1716 = 2080): Lambda^2(S^eps)* = Lambda^1 + Lambda^5 and Sym^2(S^eps)* = Lambda^3 + Lambda^7_eps; in particular
  Hom_Spin(7,7)(Lambda^3, Lambda^2 S^eps*) = 0 and Hom(Lambda^3, Lambda^2 S*) = 0 (S^+ (x) S^- = even forms).

